ndroid32":"2.2074","android64":"2.2074","mac-intel":"2.2074","mac-arm":"2.2074","ios":null},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2025-03-10T04:25:47Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T14:29:01Z"},{"name":"Better Editor Trail","description":"A Customizable Editor Trail Alternative.","version":"1.0.1","download_link":"https://api.geode-sdk.org/v1/mods/nwo5.better_editor_trail/versions/1.0.1/download","hash":"c2401cfd013ea82c6b344b40bd3e489a9a96ab5b609262c57deb62dccf964fc1","geode":"4.2.0","download_count":1276,"early_load":false,"requires_patching":false,"api":false,"mod_id":"nwo5.better_editor_trail","gd":{"win":"2.2074","android32":"2.2074","android64":"2.2074","mac-intel":"2.2074","mac-arm":"2.2074","ios":null},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2025-03-06T00:43:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T17:46:49Z"}],"tags":["editor","offline","enhancement","bugfix","customization"],"about":"# Better Editor Trail\r\nsilly trail mod\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n- dual click indicators\r\n- directional indicators for platoformer\r\n- fix indicators showing up a frame late\r\n- change trail color when holding\r\n- everything is customizable !\r\n\r\n## Credits\r\n- ***colorfulmarker*** (on the gd modding discord server) for the mod idea\r\n- ***Rue*** for the fire logo\r\n- ***Brittank*** for motivating me to do 2.0.0 and 2.1.0\r\n\r\n### Special Thanks\r\n- ***ConfiG/FiveBlueMoons*** for completely rewriting for 3.0.0 :3","changelog":"## v4.1.3\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- platformer arrows\r\n\r\n## v4.1.2\r\n**Added**\r\n\r\n- toggle for new input handling (bot fix)\r\n\r\n**Internal**\r\n\r\n- renamed some namespace to be in `nocase`\r\n\r\n## v4.1.1\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- ported to new sillyapi version\r\n- change input handling which should fix release indicators sometimes breaking (mayb ???)\r\n\r\n## v4.1.0\r\n**Added**\r\n\r\n- directional indicators toggle\r\n- new changelog formatting\r\n- semver mayb\r\n\r\n## v4.0.1\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- show holding setting\r\n\r\n## v4.0.0\r\nthe rewrite eventually\r\n\r\n## v3.0.0\r\nmerge pr (ty bluemoon or wtv name u prefer sowwy) and bump version\r\n\r\ncompletely untested but a lot of ppl want better trail do there ill make my own rewrite eventually\r\n\r\n## v2.1.1\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- segfault maybe reported by brittank\r\n\r\n## v2.1.0\r\n**Added**\r\n\r\n- trail timer setting\r\n\r\n**Fixed** \r\n\r\n- trail randomly disappearing fr i think\r\n- kinda the code i didnt wanna completely rewrite cuz i cant be bothered but omg ts was so bad its only been a few months what happened :sob: this alone is enough to justify a minor version bump icl, i couldve done more to make it \"more optimized\" or wtv but idc\r\n- node ids\r\n- credits sorry brittank-\r\n\r\n## v2.0.4\r\ni broke player input handling globally lol\r\n\r\n## v2.0.3\r\n**Added**\r\n\r\n- trail toggle button\r\n- tweaked default trail size\r\n\r\n**Removed**\r\n\r\n- toggle trail with hide path\r\n\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- show hitboxes not working with the mod oopsies\r\n- use player colors\r\n\r\n## v2.0.2\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- log statement uwasjyrfhweuysdjhz\r\n\r\n## v2.0.1\r\n**Fixed** \r\n\r\n- platformer indicators being wonky\r\n- holding fr fr trust\r\n\r\n## v2.0.0\r\n**Added** \r\n\r\n- rewrite uwu\r\n- prolly a million new bugs because this mod refuses to work properly ever :3\r\n- ios support\r\n- more shapes because the geode user base loves playing with them\r\n- separate trail sizes\r\n- prolly more optimised now even tho i doubt that was an issue\r\n- trail toggles with hide path now\r\n\r\n**Removed** \r\n\r\n- use default trail cuz thats hopefully unneeded now (also trail is tied to debugdraw now so no more selecting interval)\r\n\r\n**Fixed** \r\n\r\n- hopefully ***fixed the trail dragging issues with lag***\r\n- trail holding indicators being scuffed in 2p mode\r\n- trail holding indicators in platformer (kinda)\r\n- trail not hiding sometimes or smth\r\n- some obscure bug on some levels that broke the trail\r\n\r\n## v1.0.8\r\n**Fixed** \r\n\r\n- maybe fixed changelog\r\n- using wrong pcolor\r\n\r\n## v1.0.7\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- some crashes maybe?\r\n\r\n## v1.0.6\r\n**Added**\r\n\r\n- use default trail as a bandaid solution to ccdrawnode being weird\r\n\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- first click not showing if you died holding\r\n\r\n## v1.0.5\r\n**Added** \r\n\r\n- new formatting for changelog :3\r\n\r\n**Fixed** \r\n\r\n- p2 trail not rendering on android (hopefully) (reported by *JohnnyCena123*) (***#freejohnnycena123***)\r\n- release indicators appearing on playtest stop\r\n- trail dragging for p2 after entering dual portal again\r\n\r\n## v1.0.4\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n-use typeinfo cast\r\n\r\n## v1.0.3\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- crash with shaders on windows (reported by *Akurio64*)\r\n\r\n## v1.0.2\r\n**Added**\r\n\r\n- new fire logo by Rue\r\n\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- left and right inputs appearing in classic mode\r\n- hitboxes not rendering with this mod (oops)\r\n\r\n## v1.0.1\r\n**Fixed**\r\n\r\n- click indicators appearing on editor open\r\n- optimize fields (thanks alphalaneous)\r\n\r\n## v1.0.0\r\nInitial Release\r\n","created_at":"2025-03-06T00:43:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:24:28Z","links":{"community":"https://discord.gg/AeFeYWGUxZ","homepage":null,"source":"https://github.com/Nwo5-trg/Better-Editor-Trail"}}